{
  "title": "Add HTML fallback extraction for pre-schema Smitten Kitchen posts",
  "description": "The 2026-04-22 Paprika export surfaced at least one old \
`smittenkitchen.com` post, `2008/07/huevos-rancheros`, that reaches \
`extract_recipe` but fails because it predates the site's structured-data \
markup. Newer Smitten Kitchen pages are already covered elsewhere; this issue \
is specifically about the older post shape that still appears in real user \
exports.\n\
\n\
Split this site out of the old umbrella issue and make it stand on its own. \
The goal is that pre-schema Smitten Kitchen recipe posts can still yield a \
snapshot by extracting recipe content from the HTML body.\n\
\n\
Expected shape of the fix:\n\
\n\
  - detect the old Smitten Kitchen page shape and recover recipe structure     \
from HTML when JSON-LD is missing\n\
  - add a fixture/test for an affected old post so the behavior stays pinned\n\
  - rerun `make pipeline` and commit the resulting `data/` diffs if the     \
extraction/parsing behavior changes\n\
\n\
If the implementation ends up sharing generic bucket A fallback machinery, \
that is fine; the acceptance test is still site-specific coverage for old \
Smitten Kitchen posts.",
